--- !u!114 &1611287008
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1611287007}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2fcf87d5e31bc4742bfe98758809aefa, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SceneDialogueTrigger
  sceneLines:
  - speakerName: Luna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 053fc742baa0af94daca4893be7aca6d, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: The exit is complete. Everyone this way
  - speakerName: Luna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 053fc742baa0af94daca4893be7aca6d, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: You know this is the end for me, Dimitri.
  - speakerName: Luna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 053fc742baa0af94daca4893be7aca6d, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: Say hello to Nova for me, ok, Dimitri.
  - speakerName: Dimitri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30f65458f3f60904b9d160f5d1c01360, type: 3}
    side: 0
    text: ' This isn''t necessarily goodbye.'
  - speakerName: Luna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 053fc742baa0af94daca4893be7aca6d, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: What do you mean?
  - speakerName: Dimitri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30f65458f3f60904b9d160f5d1c01360, type: 3}
    side: 0
    text: Even though this version only exists in this alternate world, in the real
      world, you are still a part of Nova.
  - speakerName: Luna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 053fc742baa0af94daca4893be7aca6d, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: Hmmm, I didn't think about it that way. I guess I am. Thank you, Dimitri.
      Now get out of here.
  - speakerName: Dimitri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30f65458f3f60904b9d160f5d1c01360, type: 3}
    side: 0
    text: Rodger
  - speakerName: ENV
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    side: 0
    text: ...................................................We all wake up
  - speakerName: Dr Beatrice
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f07fa2c0af222444bbeb239e986e7096, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: "Welcome back\u2026"
  - speakerName: Dimitri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30f65458f3f60904b9d160f5d1c01360, type: 3}
    side: 0
    text: 'Finally!! We are finally out of this.

'
  - speakerName: Dr Beatrice
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f07fa2c0af222444bbeb239e986e7096, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: ' Before you leave, Dimitri, I want to see you.'
  - speakerName: Dimitri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30f65458f3f60904b9d160f5d1c01360, type: 3}
    side: 0
    text: Ok. It was nice meeting you all. I hope to see you again sometime.
  - speakerName: Roman
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0b630fbfd946bf54bb3f9832a11bc528, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: See ya
  - speakerName: Slvia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f7ab9e5d09f29b940b14a3047fcaa5f6, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: Goodbye, Dimitri.
  - speakerName: Catherine
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c2c4910e134143b4684c05ed8d550841, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: Good luck in the future, you crazy bastard.
  - speakerName: Dr Beatrice
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f07fa2c0af222444bbeb239e986e7096, type: 3}
    side: 0
    text: Dimitri, thank you for rescuing my daughter.
  - speakerName: 'Dimitri '
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30f65458f3f60904b9d160f5d1c01360, type: 3}
    side: 0
    text: My pleasure, I really needed the cash.
  - speakerName: Dr Beatrice
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f07fa2c0af222444bbeb239e986e7096, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: Now that you're out, what are your plans for your future?
  - speakerName: Dimitri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30f65458f3f60904b9d160f5d1c01360, type: 3}
    side: 0
    text: 'While I''m not sure right now, I know I don''t want just to sit around
      anymore. Goodbye, Dr Beatrice, and goodbye, Nova. Say hello to Luna for me. '
  - speakerName: Nova
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd53e4aa98bdf434db8c30bb120e92a4, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: Thank you, Mr Dimitri. I will. Take care!
  - speakerName: Dimitri Alter
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 10924731a072d374b97cb942e7cd5250, type: 3}
    side: 1
    text: Cheers to you, maybe we have a future after all.
  - speakerName: Dimitri
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30f65458f3f60904b9d160f5d1c01360, type: 3}
    side: 0
    text: Yeah Its up to me to pave my path forward.
  - speakerName: Game
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    side: 0
    text: The end
  - speakerName: Tristan, Adam, Adam, Cole, & Devin
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    side: 0
    text: Thanks for playing
  triggerRadius: 4
  triggerMode: 0
  triggerOnce: 1
  advanceStageOnFinish: 0
  teleportDestination: {fileID: 0}
